{"5308550":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Tsukumo SNAP!","steam_appid":5308550,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5314980],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE PHONE RANG AFTER TWELVE YEARS IN A BOX<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haru is spending the last week of summer at grandma's house in <strong>Wasure-machi<\/strong> — «the Forgotten Town». In the storeroom, inside a cardboard box, an old yellow flip phone switches itself on. Inside it lives <strong>Denpa<\/strong>: a sarcastic AI stuck forever at 4% battery, and the only thing in the world that can see <strong>tsukumogami<\/strong> — the spirits that grow inside objects people stopped caring about.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The umbrella grandma lost in 1987 has been waiting on the stairs the whole time. It is <i>thrilled<\/i> to see you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >POINT. FOCUS. SNAP.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise the TsukuLens and the town turns violet. Something is breathing inside that bush, under that vending machine, behind that shutter. Hold your breath, frame it, take the photo — a good shot earns you a friend, a bad shot earns you a blurry thumb and a spirit that is now <i>annoyed<\/i>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >161 SPIRITS, AND NOT ONE OF THEM IS NORMAL<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A raincoat that never dried. A stapler that appointed itself a judge. A vending machine with strong opinions about loyalty. Every spirit has a tribe, a personality (shy, cocky, sleepyhead…), a favourite snack and a bond that grows when you feed it.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE WHEEL<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six friends on a spinning wheel: three at the front fighting, three at the back catching their breath. Spin to rotate, aim with the camera, purify the cursed, throw snacks, and when the gauge fills — pull the trigger on a Burst and hit the rhythm.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A TOWN THAT LIVES ON YOUR CLOCK<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The calendar inside the game is <strong>your<\/strong> calendar. Festivals arrive when they arrive. A full moon is a full moon. The boss of the week rotates every real Monday, and the ghost bus only stops on Tuesdays — at places that do not exist.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT ELSE IS IN THERE<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>14 places<\/strong>: the town, a hot spring, a beach festival, a neon city, a landfill kingdom, a school at midnight, an abandoned hospital, the sewers, a dead train tunnel, the spirit back-alley, and the same town in <strong>1987<\/strong>.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Tsukumo League<\/strong>: eight rivals scattered across the world, and a tournament that will humble you.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Tower of the Forgotten<\/strong>: 50 floors, random modifiers, no mercy.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishing, gachapon, karaoke duels, menko, cooking, a bug net, an onsen, a TV channel, rumours, photo quests and a free photo mode<\/strong> with filters, stickers and frames.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your own room<\/strong> to decorate with everything you drag home, and your photos framed on the wall.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two-player co-op<\/strong> where the second player is Denpa: a cursor that marks targets and throws snacks.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE TONE<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warm, silly and occasionally sad, in the way that only a story about things people threw away can be. Denpa will insult you. You will grow fond of a stapler. Around chapter six you may need a moment.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Isekai Games<\/strong><\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE PHONE RANG AFTER TWELVE YEARS IN A BOX<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haru is spending the last week of summer at grandma's house in <strong>Wasure-machi<\/strong> — «the Forgotten Town». In the storeroom, inside a cardboard box, an old yellow flip phone switches itself on. Inside it lives <strong>Denpa<\/strong>: a sarcastic AI stuck forever at 4% battery, and the only thing in the world that can see <strong>tsukumogami<\/strong> — the spirits that grow inside objects people stopped caring about.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The umbrella grandma lost in 1987 has been waiting on the stairs the whole time. It is <i>thrilled<\/i> to see you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >POINT. FOCUS. SNAP.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise the TsukuLens and the town turns violet. Something is breathing inside that bush, under that vending machine, behind that shutter. Hold your breath, frame it, take the photo — a good shot earns you a friend, a bad shot earns you a blurry thumb and a spirit that is now <i>annoyed<\/i>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >161 SPIRITS, AND NOT ONE OF THEM IS NORMAL<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A raincoat that never dried. A stapler that appointed itself a judge. A vending machine with strong opinions about loyalty. Every spirit has a tribe, a personality (shy, cocky, sleepyhead…), a favourite snack and a bond that grows when you feed it.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE WHEEL<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six friends on a spinning wheel: three at the front fighting, three at the back catching their breath. Spin to rotate, aim with the camera, purify the cursed, throw snacks, and when the gauge fills — pull the trigger on a Burst and hit the rhythm.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A TOWN THAT LIVES ON YOUR CLOCK<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The calendar inside the game is <strong>your<\/strong> calendar. Festivals arrive when they arrive. A full moon is a full moon. The boss of the week rotates every real Monday, and the ghost bus only stops on Tuesdays — at places that do not exist.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT ELSE IS IN THERE<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>14 places<\/strong>: the town, a hot spring, a beach festival, a neon city, a landfill kingdom, a school at midnight, an abandoned hospital, the sewers, a dead train tunnel, the spirit back-alley, and the same town in <strong>1987<\/strong>.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Tsukumo League<\/strong>: eight rivals scattered across the world, and a tournament that will humble you.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Tower of the Forgotten<\/strong>: 50 floors, random modifiers, no mercy.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishing, gachapon, karaoke duels, menko, cooking, a bug net, an onsen, a TV channel, rumours, photo quests and a free photo mode<\/strong> with filters, stickers and frames.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your own room<\/strong> to decorate with everything you drag home, and your photos framed on the wall.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two-player co-op<\/strong> where the second player is Denpa: a cursor that marks targets and throws snacks.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE TONE<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warm, silly and occasionally sad, in the way that only a story about things people threw away can be. Denpa will insult you. You will grow fond of a stapler. Around chapter six you may need a moment.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Isekai Games<\/strong><\/p>","short_description":"Every forgotten thing grows a soul. Photograph them with your grandma's ancient flip phone, befriend 161 spirits, and spin them into battle. A comedy monster-collecting RPG in a Japanese town that changes with the real calendar.","supported_languages":"English, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5308550\/f13db67847a6b0c5f9f446628f7a4b31dc69431e\/header.jpg?t=1793113264","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5308550\/322a468b95b4540e8a1cc74990c8231ad8c531d5\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793113264","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5308550\/322a468b95b4540e8a1cc74990c8231ad8c531d5\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793113264","website":"https:\/\/isekai-games.pages.dev\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["ISEKAI Games"],"publishers":["ISEKAI Games"],"demos":[{"appid":5314980,"description":""}],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":999,"final":999,"discount_percent":0,"initial_formatted":"","final_formatted":"$9.99"},"packages":[1834813],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Tsukumo SNAP!","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1834813,"percent_savings_text":" ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Tsukumo SNAP! - $9.99","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":999}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":1,"description":"Multi-player"},{"id":9,"description":"Co-op"},{"id":39,"description":"Shared\/Split Screen Co-op"},{"id":24,"description":"Shared\/Split Screen"},{"id":44,"description":"Remote Play Together"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"25","description":"Adventure"},{"id":"23","description":"Indie"},{"id":"3","description":"RPG"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5308550\/52cbdec386402be37eeaa34cbf685a7ca0600884\/ss_52cbdec386402be37eeaa34cbf685a7ca0600884.600x338.jpg?t=1793113264","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5308550\/52cbdec386402be37eeaa34cbf685a7ca0600884\/ss_52cbdec386402be37eeaa34cbf685a7ca0600884.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793113264"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5308550\/8a07a99103b0b292bffc5aefa9ecf53d3778e4e1\/ss_8a07a99103b0b292bffc5aefa9ecf53d3778e4e1.600x338.jpg?t=1793113264","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5308550\/8a07a99103b0b292bffc5aefa9ecf53d3778e4e1\/ss_8a07a99103b0b292bffc5aefa9ecf53d3778e4e1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793113264"},{"id":2,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5308550\/11d3ac176aa56f175639a4193511833513e1f8a3\/ss_11d3ac176aa56f175639a4193511833513e1f8a3.600x338.jpg?t=1793113264","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5308550\/11d3ac176aa56f175639a4193511833513e1f8a3\/ss_11d3ac176aa56f175639a4193511833513e1f8a3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793113264"},{"id":3,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5308550\/2b06965d29c5028cb41a8731b077962e5a2d7778\/ss_2b06965d29c5028cb41a8731b077962e5a2d7778.600x338.jpg?t=1793113264","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5308550\/2b06965d29c5028cb41a8731b077962e5a2d7778\/ss_2b06965d29c5028cb41a8731b077962e5a2d7778.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793113264"},{"id":4,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5308550\/fc03c2a5d1210bee519a7f4c21e9de105a9aa374\/ss_fc03c2a5d1210bee519a7f4c21e9de105a9aa374.600x338.jpg?t=1793113264","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5308550\/fc03c2a5d1210bee519a7f4c21e9de105a9aa374\/ss_fc03c2a5d1210bee519a7f4c21e9de105a9aa374.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793113264"},{"id":5,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5308550\/2fa6b663c4d110810ee98ad996567d06b3995204\/ss_2fa6b663c4d110810ee98ad996567d06b3995204.600x338.jpg?t=1793113264","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5308550\/2fa6b663c4d110810ee98ad996567d06b3995204\/ss_2fa6b663c4d110810ee98ad996567d06b3995204.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793113264"},{"id":6,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5308550\/87736efde5c72a5062a0a80cd7bbb19d9db8b324\/ss_87736efde5c72a5062a0a80cd7bbb19d9db8b324.600x338.jpg?t=1793113264","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5308550\/87736efde5c72a5062a0a80cd7bbb19d9db8b324\/ss_87736efde5c72a5062a0a80cd7bbb19d9db8b324.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793113264"},{"id":7,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5308550\/6977ff1197d2ee4a11881b40f5e050a38e8bf30c\/ss_6977ff1197d2ee4a11881b40f5e050a38e8bf30c.600x338.jpg?t=1793113264","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5308550\/6977ff1197d2ee4a11881b40f5e050a38e8bf30c\/ss_6977ff1197d2ee4a11881b40f5e050a38e8bf30c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793113264"},{"id":8,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5308550\/6765448f8b253517aafd4e4948ecb834a113190a\/ss_6765448f8b253517aafd4e4948ecb834a113190a.600x338.jpg?t=1793113264","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5308550\/6765448f8b253517aafd4e4